        <mxCell id="OCR" value="&lt;b&gt;OCR worker — Lane A&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;YOLO + PaddleOCR + voting&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;needs GPU / weights / video&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#12324f;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
